OL,3,GNEWSAUni students' fears over
OL,4,Aessay-checker AI plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FUniversity students have raised
OL,7,Fconcerns over the software used to
OL,8,Fsubmit assignments and check them for
OL,9,Fplagiarism, amid fears their work could
OL,10,Fbe used to train tools which use
OL,11,Fartificial intelligence.
OL,13,FThe University of York Students' Union
OL,14,Fsaid planned changes to the licence
OL,15,Fagreement for the Turnitin system could
OL,16,Fsee students' work used to teach AI
OL,17,Fmodels.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
