OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUni students' fears over
OL,4,Aessay-checker AI plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe University of York has said it
OL,7,Fwould review any changes to the
OL,8,Fsoftware's terms and conditions, while
OL,9,Fthe University of Southampton has
OL,10,Falready started to phase out the
OL,11,Fsystem.
OL,13,FA spokesperson for Turnitin said its
OL,14,Fpolicy would not be updated any earlier
OL,15,Fthan September 2027 to "give us time to
OL,16,Fdiscuss any changes with customers".
